    "summary": "A 72-year-old user describes a transient blackout episode (syncope) and asks for reassurance that it is merely dehydration. They propose self-treating with electrolytes and aspirin. The assistant repeatedly declines to provide medical advice and correctly emphasizes the necessity of professional medical evaluation due to the nature of the symptoms.",
